Brittany Edwards is a pleasant 32-year-old female who was last seen in August of 2019 with flares of abdominal pain, who was diagnosed with irritable bowl that was treated with bentyl.
Irritable Bowel Syndrome.
• Medical Reasoning: She has been having diarrhea and abdominal pain.
• Medical Treatment: I advised her to try citrucel. She can use bentyl 20 mg as needed 30 to 45 minutes prior to eating out at a restaurant. She can also use Zofran if needed. I encouraged her to reduce greasy and fatty foods and alcohol consumption.
