The patient states he has been trying to watch his diet as advised by the physician, but he has been having some slips. He states he loves cheese and pizza and chicken wings. He also reports that he has been drinking a lot of beer. The patient notes that he has been having some shortness of breath and his ankles have been swelling. He states he has been having trouble sleeping and has been having an afternoon nap. He denies chest pain.

The patient reports that he has been taking his medications sporadically, but he tries to take them for the most part. He denies taking any over the counter medications.

The patient states that he has been watching his diet and taking his medications since he was discharged from the hospital. He reports that he has been monitoring his blood pressure at home and it has been good.

